Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.49,Cap,,0,0,0,,This child has Mosaic Variegated Aneuploidy type 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.49,0:00:05.84,Cap,,0,0,0,,Two variants in BUB1B.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.84,0:00:12.01,Cap,,0,0,0,,A stop at codon 737 — ClinVar already calls it pathogenic for this exact disease.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.01,0:00:18.35,Cap,,0,0,0,,And a novel missense at asparagine 1002, absent from gnomAD, in the pseudokinase domain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.45,0:00:26.01,Cap,,0,0,0,,It ranked first genome-wide with no gene-panel prior, and we confirmed it from the raw reads.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.25,0:00:30.88,Cap,,0,0,0,,The truncating allele makes no protein. Nonsense-mediated decay removes it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.88,0:00:33.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,So everything this child has comes from the other copy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.00,0:00:37.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,And the work on that class of mutation is unusually clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.50,0:00:40.79,Cap,,0,0,0,,These are not broken proteins. They are scarce proteins.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.79,0:00:45.93,Cap,,0,0,0,,Same messenger RNA. Five to ten times less protein. Twice the turnover.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.93,0:00:50.07,Cap,,0,0,0,,Force them back to normal levels and the checkpoint works perfectly again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.22,0:00:56.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,This is not a disease of a protein that doesn't function. It's one that doesn't last.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.45,0:00:59.91,Cap,,0,0,0,,That reframes the target — and it lets us put a number on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.01,0:01:03.53,Cap,,0,0,0,,The dose-response for BUBR1 is a switch, not a slope.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.53,0:01:06.59,Cap,,0,0,0,,Six percent of normal, and most cells missegregate.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.59,0:01:09.93,Cap,,0,0,0,,Thirteen percent, and segregation is essentially fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.08,0:01:13.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,This child sits between five and ten percent. Right on the edge.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.35,0:01:20.71,Cap,,0,0,0,,To get him over the line, raise one destabilised protein by 1.3 to 2.6 fold.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.81,0:01:24.25,Cap,,0,0,0,,Not restore it. Not replace the gene. Roughly double it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.45,0:01:30.42,Cap,,0,0,0,,A drug-scale target — and a bar every candidate must clear, set before we run anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.77,0:01:33.02,Cap,,0,0,0,,Now the part we think matters most.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.12,0:01:37.82,Cap,,0,0,0,,Every published aneuploidy-selective drug kills aneuploid cells preferentially.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.82,0:01:42.13,Cap,,0,0,0,,In a tumour inside a healthy patient, that difference is the whole therapy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.28,0:01:47.96,Cap,,0,0,0,,But here, the patient is the aneuploid organism. Brain, muscle, marrow all carry it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.01,0:01:51.06,Cap,,0,0,0,,The therapeutic index isn't narrow. It's inverted.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.41,0:01:55.69,Cap,,0,0,0,,So that literature is a list of things to avoid here, not a list of leads.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.80,0:01:59.75,Cap,,0,0,0,,And HSP90 inhibitors are the worst of them for this child.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.75,0:02:04.29,Cap,,0,0,0,,His surviving allele is the one that depends on HSP90 to fold.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.29,0:02:07.41,Cap,,0,0,0,,You'd be stripping away the only working copy he has.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.66,0:02:11.02,Cap,,0,0,0,,The same logic rules out senolytics and growth hormone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.02,0:02:14.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,And it raises a question nobody has asked about his current treatment.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.25,0:02:20.39,Cap,,0,0,0,,He has rhabdomyosarcoma. Rhabdomyosarcoma is treated with vincristine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.64,0:02:24.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,Vinca alkaloids don't kill by damaging microtubules.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.20,0:02:29.14,Cap,,0,0,0,,They kill by holding a cell in mitotic arrest, maintained by the spindle checkpoint.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.24,0:02:31.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,His checkpoint is the disease.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.30,0:02:36.21,Cap,,0,0,0,,His cells slip out of arrest in about an hour, where normal cells hold indefinitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.36,0:02:40.62,Cap,,0,0,0,,So the prediction is they don't die. They escape, carrying a wrecked genome.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.72,0:02:45.95,Cap,,0,0,0,,In a child with a 37% lifetime cancer risk, that's a serious question.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.05,0:02:48.33,Cap,,0,0,0,,One plate of patient cells answers it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.78,0:02:52.98,Cap,,0,0,0,,One cell system. Three readouts. One threshold, set in advance.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.99,0:02:56.21,Cap,,0,0,0,,Protein up 1.3 fold, or it isn't a hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.46,0:03:00.01,Cap,,0,0,0,,Everything is public, and it runs on one CPU. Thank you.
